@startuml
title FR-07 - Remove Blood Bank Staff Assignment - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Blood Bank HRM or\nBlood Bank Administrator|
start
:Identify the staff member\nassigned to the bank;

|Client|
:Display the target assignment;

|Blood Bank HRM or\nBlood Bank Administrator|
:Click the remove button;

|Client|
:Display the removal confirmation prompt;

|Blood Bank HRM or\nBlood Bank Administrator|
if (Confirm removal?) then ([Yes])
  :Click the confirmation button;

  |Server — Accounts|
  :Check that the assignment still exists,\nis active for the specified bank, and is\nwithin the actor's authority;

  if (Still assigned to the bank\nand removal is authorized?) then ([Yes])
    :Deactivate the specified\nblood bank assignment;

    |Client|
    :Display the removal result;
    stop

  else ([No])
    |Server — Accounts|
    :Reject the removal;

    |Client|
    :Display the reason removal was rejected;
    stop
  endif

else ([No])
  |Blood Bank HRM or\nBlood Bank Administrator|
  :Cancel removal;
  stop
endif

@enduml